#ShriAmarnathJiYatra2025
LG Sh Manoj Sinha chaired a meeting to review the final preparations for Shri Amarnath Ji Yatra. He directed for widespread publicity of the Traffic Advisory so that the common man is not inconvenienced. DCs to ensure that lodgement centres and sanitation units are in good condition.
